+      "messageBody": "\u20262 scope-lock-preserved\n\n- A4: packaging declared (wheel ships pcp + console script, PROVEN) but installed\n  import still blocked by repo-root schema loading in 4 modules \u2192 tracked follow-up\n  'PCP wheel-safe schema loading'. Clean-venv import gate = FAIL (known/deferred).\n- A2: reflect DROP_FROM_PR1 (no proof.* authority entry; Packet-5 scope-lock intact);\n  2 proof_status_map tests; authority modeling deferred.\n- Honest validation buckets (wheel CONTENTS pass, clean-venv import fail).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
