+      "messageBody": "\u2026tatus_map\n\nA2 proof-family follow-up (exporter-consumption). New dopemux.pcp.dcp_extension_export\nmodule WRAPS the generic, project-agnostic dopemux.pcp.exporter.export_evidence (does\nNOT modify it) and, when the target repo carries the DCP extension manifest, resolves\nthe declared proof_status_mappings -> proof_status_map -> proof_pointers and enriches\nthe export's proof_manifest from real repo state (PRESENT/ABSENT + path), keeping the\nresult schema-valid. No import-time file I/O (wheel-safe). Generic export returned\nunchanged when no DCP extension is present.\n\nIncrement 1 = presence resolution; SHA-based freshness (CURRENT/STALE) deferred\n(proof-bundle formats are heterogeneous, no canonical schema yet) -> freshness=UNKNOWN.\n\nTests: tests/project_control_plane/test_dcp_extension_export.py (3) \u2014 generic fallback,\nDCP-present-proof, DCP-absent-proof; all assert enriched output validates against\nproject_evidence_export.schema.json.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
