+      "messageBody": "Completes the A2 follow-up the #977 DROP_FROM_PR1 ruling deferred: 'model proof.*\nownership cleanly (not the MCP adapter set)'. Adds the proof.dopemux_family authority\nentry (owner = the project itself; read-only ADAPTER over PROOF.json/SUMMARY.md;\ncanonical_writer null; live_write_allowed false; BLOCK_OR_ESCALATE).\n\nThe Packet-5 scope-lock is refined to a TWO-PLANE guard keyed by domain prefix:\n  - ADAPTER plane (the 11 MCP-system owners) \u2014 EXPECTED_SYSTEMS and adapter_mappings\n    UNCHANGED (no 'dopemux' added) \u2192 the operator's protected scope-lock is preserved.\n  - PROOF-FAMILY plane (proof.* domains) \u2014 guarded separately; NOT in adapter_mappings.\n\nThis is the clean model the deferral called for: proof artifacts are owned by the\nproject, not an external MCP adapter, so they get their own plane rather than being\nforced into (and bumping) the adapter set.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
