+      "messageBody": "\u2026eFailure\n\nnative_hooks previously emitted only content-free heartbeat pings to the\ndopemux:events stream, which the dope-memory promotion engine does not\nconsume, leaving the chronicle's work_log_entries empty. Wire the\nPostToolUseFailure handler to the deterministic capture spine\n(capture_client.emit_capture_event) with event_type=error.encountered,\nthe one hook-available type on the WMA promotion allowlist. Fail-open:\ncapture errors never propagate to the session. Session/file-edit events\nare intentionally NOT wired \u2014 they are heartbeat (non-promotable) and\nwould recreate the spam this fixes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
