+{
+  "baseRefName": "main",
+  "body": "## Summary\n\nRepair merged dope-context Voyage modernization (PR #1112 / post-merge Opus audit FAIL) before first deployment.\n\n### Audit source\n- Parent: PR #1112 merge `4b42268775d1f94e26500c758128da3e11b151d5`\n- Audit packet: `TP-DOPECONTEXT-VOYAGE4-POSTMERGE-OPUS-AUDIT-001` \u2192 `REPAIR_REQUIRED`\n- This packet: `TP-DOPECONTEXT-VOYAGE4-REPAIR-0002`\n\n### Blocking findings repaired\n- **F-001** Code `content_vec` index/query vector-space mismatch \u2192 query uses same contextualized model/endpoint as index\n- **F-002** Collection compatibility/migration gate \u2192 fingerprint-versioned collection names; legacy never written\n- **F-003** Legacy-context rollback split \u2192 single `DOPE_CONTEXT_CONTEXTUAL_EMBED_MODEL` moves all contextual paths\n\n### Design selected for code content_vec\nBehavior-preserving: configured contextual model + `contextualized_embeddings` on both index and query (query: single chunk, auto-chunking off, exactly one vector). Title/breadcrumb remain `voyage-code-3` / embeddings.\n\n### Collection migration behavior\n- Active: `code_<ws-hash>_<profile-digest>` / `docs_<ws-hash>_<profile-digest>`\n- Changing model/endpoint/dimension/dtype/chunker/schema \u2192 new collection identity\n- Local manifest mismatch fails closed before upsert\n\n### Legacy collection behavior\n- Detected and reported in `get_index_status`\n- Never selected for new writes\n- Never auto-deleted\n\n### Rollback command\n```bash\nexport DOPE_CONTEXT_CONTEXTUAL_EMBED_MODEL=voyage-context-3\n```\n\n### Tests and validation\n- Full dope-context suite: **74 passed**\n- `uv lock --check` PASS (voyageai `>=0.5.0,<0.6`)\n- Docker build `dope-context:repair-0002` PASS\n- No-network container smoke: voyageai `0.5.0` SMOKE_OK\n\n### Embedded auditor\n- Preferred Gemini CLI / AGY / Claude Code Opus **blocked** this window (tier + quota)\n- Verdict: **NOT_RUN** (implementer must not self-PASS)\n- See `proof/TP-DOPECONTEXT-VOYAGE4-REPAIR-0002/AUDITOR_REPORT.md`\n\n### Residual risks\n- Independent embedded audit still required for steward READY\n- No live Voyage billable benchmark\n- Operator reindex required for legacy collections\n\n### Deployment\n**Explicitly NOT performed** in this packet.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `PYTHONPATH=services/dope-context uv run --extra services --extra test pytest -q services/dope-context/tests`\n- [x] Docker build + no-network smoke\n- [ ] Independent embedded audit PASS / PASS_WITH_RISKS\n- [ ] PR Steward MERGE_READINESS=READY\n- [ ] Do not deploy from this PR without operator approval",
