+  "body": "## Summary\n\nImplements **ADR-DMX-MCPPROF-001** (Accepted 2026-07-26) after operator phrase `ACCEPT AND EXECUTE TP-MCP-PROFILE-PROGRAM-001-R1` (supervisor packet `TP-MCP-PROFILE-PROGRAM-001-R1`).\n\nAdds deterministic **profile-selected MCP tool plane**:\n\n- Profiles in `mcp_catalog.yaml` (no implicit `all`)\n- `profile_policy.py` inventory, digests, admin/write filters, fixed-path `repo-domain-read` contract\n- CLI: `dopemux mcp profile list|show`, `doctor --profile`, `init --profile`, `generate --profile`\n- Official GitHub read-only server entry + specialized Playwright/Semgrep/domain-read placement\n- Unit tests for fail-closed negatives; docs + mcp-system PAL stdio truth\n\n**Merge is NOT authorized** by this packet.\n\n### Allowlist amendment (supervisor-approved)\n\n- `schemas/mcp/fleet-catalog.schema.json` \u2014 `profiles` + enums for new servers\n- `src/dopemux/mcp/default_catalog.yaml` \u2014 keep in sync with root catalog\n- `mcp_tool_surfaces.json` \u2014 planned/seed keys for new servers (live capture unavailable)\n\n### Acceptance evidence\n\n- ADR status: **Accepted** with date 2026-07-26, operator phrase, unlocks `TP-DMX-MCPPROF-001`\n- Proof: `proof/TP-DMX-MCPPROF-001/`\n- Auditor: `PASS_WITH_RISKS` (second-pass invariant audit; formal AGY/Claude CLI not available)\n\n### Profile digests (core)\n\n| Profile | tools | profile_digest (prefix) |\n|---|---:|---|\n| core-code | 51 | `27f4d06e9c55\u2026` |\n| core-retrieval | 42 | `d1eba84d64a7\u2026` |\n| planning-audit | 15 | `e9e8f92d5c7d\u2026` |\n| ui-audit | 8 | `2afe4e86f8d5\u2026` (domain-read blocked without contract) |\n\n### Validation (local)\n\n- profile unit tests: PASS\n- mcp unit filter + arch fleet catalog: PASS\n- ruff on touched modules: PASS\n- mypy: FAIL (pre-existing noise on mcp_commands/fleet_catalog; recorded)\n- `git diff --check`: PASS\n\n### Residual risks\n\n- GitHub tool names seeded for policy filters; refresh with live snapshot when available\n- `repo-domain-