+      "messageBody": "The docs-frontmatter-guard pre-commit hook requires YAML frontmatter on\nmarkdown under task-packets/; the load plan shipped without it, so the\nhook auto-fixed the file in CI and exited 1, failing the checks and\nCode Quality jobs.\n\nAdds the frontmatter the guard generates, with a meaningful title and\nprelude in place of the derived boilerplate.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
