+      "messageBody": "\u2026cy v3\n\nConfirmed residual of R3-002 (27b349dd3): v5 wraps untrusted repo content,\nv3 does not (run_extraction_v3.py:6424, 0 repo_content occurrences) and v3\ncan still dispatch live behind --allow-legacy-v3-scan + --execute +\nDPMX_LIVE_OK. Resolves the agent's UNKNOWN into a tracked packet.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
