+      "messageBody": "\u2026ntrypoint\n\nF-31 was verified at v4 only. v5 (the canonical runner per rte_config.RUNNER_SCRIPT)\nnever called validate_promptset_sections, so `python run_extraction_v5.py` skipped\nthe anti-fabrication section contract entirely.\n\nWired validation into v5's preflight (_validate_promptset_sections_preflight) called\nat main() startup, fail-closed when required sections are missing. Reused v4's\nvalidation logic. Skips missing prompt files during preflight (they'll be caught as\nblocked promptset later), but enforces section contract for all available prompts.\n\nAdded test: test_v5_canonical_entrypoint_rejects_missing_sections \u2014 pins that v5\nrejects templates missing required sections at startup.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
