+      "messageBody": "\u2026ring + W/X/Z nits\n\nMechanical corrections for three identified prompt defects:\n- F-34: graph outputs declared with wrong kind (D3, E3, R5, X4); changed kind: json_item_list \u2192 json_graph + itemlist_by_id \u2192 graph_merge\n- F-35: duplicate/broken step numbering in E1\u2013E6, G0, G4, R1\u2013R8; renumbered generic tail sequentially\n- F-49: W/X/Z template nits including missing required_item_fields, stale line references, artifact name drift, and v3\u2192v4 path update\n\nAll promptset tests pass (40 tests). Golden harness tests pass (23 tests + 1 skipped).\nScope maintained: only services/repo-truth-extractor/promptsets/v4/prompts/ touched.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
