+      "committedDate": "2026-07-27T19:35:22Z",
+      "messageBody": "\u2026of the repo tree\n\nF-06: build_config() defaulted --output-dir to REPO_ROOT/reports/repo-truth-\nextractor/pre_live_gate_v25/<run-id> whenever the operator omitted the flag, so\nevery default gate run wrote artifacts into the worktree. Default now resolves\nto ~/.dopemux/reports/repo-truth-extractor/pre_live_gate_v25/<run-id>, matching\nthe user-home state-dir convention already used elsewhere in this service, and\n--help states where artifacts land. An explicit --output-dir is untouched and\nstill honored verbatim, including paths inside the repo.\n\nEvidence the bug was not theoretical: `git ls-files` shows 78 files already\ntracked under reports/repo-truth-extractor/pre_live_gate_v25/ \u2014 prior default\nruns whose artifacts landed in the tree and were committed. Removing them is\nthe separate blocked packet TP-RTE-TRUTH-R0-008 (needs an operator decision on\nwhich committed runs are load-bearing); untouched here.\n\nVerified by independent mutation check, run rather than asserted: reverting the\ndefault back to REPO_ROOT turns\ntest_build_config_default_output_dir_is_outside_repo_tree RED with\n\"default output_dir <worktree>/reports/... lands inside repo tree <worktree>\";\nrestoring returns the file to green (15 passed). The test drives the real call\nsite (build_arg_parser -> build_config), not the constant.\n\nThe implementing agent reported the companion test\ntest_build_config_honors_explicit_output_dir_even_inside_repo as NOT_RUN for\nmutation purposes \u2014 correctly, since no code path it changed can falsify that\ninvariant. Recorded rather than papered over.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
