+{
+  "baseRefName": "main",
+  "body": "Bumps the npm_and_yarn group with 3 updates in the /ui-dashboard directory: [brace-expansion](https://github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion), [postcss](https://github.com/postcss/postcss) and [undici](https://github.com/nodejs/undici).\n\nUpdates `brace-expansion` from 5.0.6 to 5.0.8\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/commit/96a63c0011c0288846ad41773c73e3fbd0906b59\"><code>96a63c0</code></a> 5.0.8</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/commit/a1bd33999ea75262c4749fff3bbb0d1372bd07b5\"><code>a1bd339</code></a> Merge commit from fork</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/commit/592a36fd18455c37f81e0848a642d84c63147fa7\"><code>592a36f</code></a> Bump tar from 7.5.16 to 7.5.20 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/issues/127\">#127</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/commit/bd146909cd6c7bedde61a5d6428ba252860a0159\"><code>bd14690</code></a> Bump brace-expansion from 2.0.2 to 2.1.2 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/issues/126\">#126</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/commit/e729ba647887042f16b531fdb3d8ac3d7762ccad\"><code>e729ba6</code></a> Bump ws from 8.19.0 to 8.21.1 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/issues/124\">#124</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/commit/5bf809e2c6dbde64dd9ff7acec7335ea7d5f6d9e\"><code>5bf809e</code></a> Remove Node.js 18 support (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/issues/110\">#110</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/commit/8cb5716bae73e98b63f18aae8e48b6f12522e759\"><code>8cb5716</code></a> Bump markdown-it from 14.1.0 to 14.2.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/issues/113\">#113</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/commit/43122df5955511b8ec82718fa28903b6dbad0d26\"><code>43122df</code></a> Bump sigstore from 4.1.0 to 4.1.1 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/issues/119\">#119</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/commit/69bd65a46e9361c992bb43b898c9df0d9720cc5c\"><code>69bd65a</code></a> Bump <code>@\u200bsigstore/verify</code> from 3.1.0 to 3.1.1 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/issues/118\">#118</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/commit/b3bfbf06746fe92645ffd17d1f44e95f480cfe59\"><code>b3bfbf0</code></a> Bump <code>@\u200bsigstore/core</code> from 3.1.0 to 3.2.1 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/issues/117\">#117</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a href=\"https://github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/compare/v5.0.6...v5.0.8\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `postcss` from 8.5.15 to 8.5.23\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/postcss/postcss/releases\">postcss's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>8.5.23</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Do not load source map without <code>opts.from</code> for security reasons.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>8.5.22</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed custom property losing semicolon before a comment (by <a href=\"https://github.com/sarathfrancis90\"><code>@\u200bsarathfrancis90</code></a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>8.5.21</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed childless at-rule losing semicolon before comment (by <a href=\"https://github.com/sarathfrancis90\"><code>@\u200bsarathfrancis90</code></a>).</li>\n<li>Fixed docs (by <a href=\"https://github.com/isker\"><code>@\u200bisker</code></a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>8.5.20</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed missing space if <code>AtRule#params</code> is set after (by <a href=\"https://github.com/sarathfrancis90\"><code>@\u200bsarathfrancis90</code></a>).</li>\n<li>Fixed mixing AST error on warnings (by <a href=\"https://github.com/MahinAnowar\"><code>@\u200bMahinAnowar</code></a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>8.5.19</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed cleaning <code>before</code> for new nodes inserted to <code>Root</code> (by <a href=\"https://github.com/MahinAnowar\"><code>@\u200bMahinAnowar</code></a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>8.5.18</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Restricted loading previous source maps file to the <code>opts.from</code> folder for security reasons (use <code>unsafeMap: true</code> to disable the check).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>8.5.17</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed <code>Maximum call stack size exceeded</code> error.</li>\n<li>Fixed Prototype hijacking for <code>postcss.fromJSON()</code>.</li>\n<li>Fixed <code>Input#origin()</code> for unmapped end position (by <a href=\"https://github.com/chatman-media\"><code>@\u200bchatman-media</code></a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>8.5.16</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed <code>Input#origin()</code> position (by <a href=\"https://github.com/mizdra\"><code>@\u200bmizdra</code></a>).</li>\n<li>Fixed <code>raws</code> after rehydrating a JSON AST (by <a href=\"https://github.com/sarathfrancis90\"><code>@\u200bsarathfrancis90</code></a>).</li>\n<li>Fixed putting parent-less node in <code>nodes</code> of new node (by <a href=\"https://github.com/MahinAnowar\"><code>@\u200bMahinAnowar</code></a>).</li>\n<li>Fixed computing <code>offset</code> in <code>positionBy()</code> (by <a href=\"https://github.com/greymoth-jp\"><code>@\u200bgreymoth-jp</code></a>).</li>\n<li>Fixed <code>rangeBy()</code> on <code>index: 0</code> (by <a href=\"https://github.com/sarathfrancis90\"><code>@\u200bsarathfrancis90</code></a>).</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/postcss/postcss/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">postcss's changelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>8.5.23</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Do not load source map without <code>opts.from</code> for security reasons.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>8.5.22</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed custom property losing semicolon before a comment (by <a href=\"https://github.com/sarathfrancis90\"><code>@\u200bsarathfrancis90</code></a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>8.5.21</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed childless at-rule losing semicolon before comment (by <a href=\"https://github.com/sarathfrancis90\"><code>@\u200bsarathfrancis90</code></a>).</li>\n<li>Fixed docs (by <a href=\"https://github.com/isker\"><code>@\u200bisker</code></a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>8.5.20</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed missing space if <code>AtRule#params</code> is set after (by <a href=\"https://github.com/sarathfrancis90\"><code>@\u200bsarathfrancis90</code></a>).</li>\n<li>Fixed mixing AST error on warnings (by <a href=\"https://github.com/MahinAnowar\"><code>@\u200bMahinAnowar</code></a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>8.5.19</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed cleaning <code>before</code> for new nodes inserted to <code>Root</code> (by <a href=\"https://github.com/MahinAnowar\"><code>@\u200bMahinAnowar</code></a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>8.5.18</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Restricted loading previous source maps file to the <code>opts.from</code> folder for security reasons (use <code>unsafeMap: true</code> to disable the check).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>8.5.17</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed <code>Maximum call stack size exceeded</code> error.</li>\n<li>Fixed Prototype hijacking for <code>postcss.fromJSON()</code>.</li>\n<li>Fixed <code>Input#origin()</code> for unmapped end position (by <a href=\"https://github.com/chatman-media\"><code>@\u200bchatman-media</code></a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>8.5.16</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed <code>Input#origin()</code> position (by <a href=\"https://github.com/mizdra\"><code>@\u200bmizdra</code></a>).</li>\n<li>Fixed <code>raws</code> after rehydrating a JSON AST (by <a href=\"https://github.com/sarathfrancis90\"><code>@\u200bsarathfrancis90</code></a>).</li>\n<li>Fixed putting parent-less node in <code>nodes</code> of new node (by <a href=\"https://github.com/MahinAnowar\"><code>@\u200bMahinAnowar</code></a>).</li>\n<li>Fixed computing <code>offset</code> in <code>positionBy()</code> (by <a href=\"https://github.com/greymoth-jp\"><code>@\u200bgreymoth-jp</code></a>).</li>\n<li>Fixed <code>rangeBy()</code> on <code>index: 0</code> (by <a href=\"https://github.com/sarathfrancis90\"><code>@\u200bsarathfrancis90</code></a>).</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/postcss/postcss/commit/eb9e1fe793740bb3280bdf5bf98147f857f011bd\"><code>eb9e1fe</code></a> Release 8.5.23 version</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/postcss/postcss/commit/9d19c78ac91108b3f7d7130e55c6fa806c0efb84\"><code>9d19c78</code></a> Update dependencies</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/postcss/postcss/commit/7beca139e70f9075c6b19700fcb00dd8033e5da8\"><code>7beca13</code></a> Does no load source map file without opts.from</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/postcss/postcss/commit/decea51421682341401575b3740709fda0e12930\"><code>decea51</code></a> Typo</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/postcss/postcss/commit/c18e30d126395d42a0726aa00e03a8f1088985ae\"><code>c18e30d</code></a> Update EM banner</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/postcss/postcss/commit/98a39ad73d163a90be924d5126c771262110f1fc\"><code>98a39ad</code></a> Update EM banner</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/postcss/postcss/commit/a3e48c492ddec0e4879d513b8b995fee887af352\"><code>a3e48c4</code></a> Release 8.5.22 version</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/postcss/postcss/commit/f49d6911795f53b2cfe023bb686bf1144ec30618\"><code>f49d691</code></a> Fix custom property losing its semicolon before a comment (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/postcss/postcss/issues/2117\">#2117</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/postcss/postcss/commit/28e0daf8f2fe5ba9e19ea3f8c27c8fe176f9419e\"><code>28e0daf</code></a> Release 8.5.21 version</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/postcss/postcss/commit/3d2b4e43e38274f233b5609d09687cadad8215d9\"><code>3d2b4e4</code></a> Update dependencies</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a href=\"https://github.com/postcss/postcss/compare/8.5.15...8.5.23\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Maintainer changes</summary>\n<p>This version was pushed to npm by <a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/~GitHub%20Actions\">GitHub Actions</a>, a new releaser for postcss since your current version.</p>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `undici` from 7.24.3 to 8.9.0\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/nodejs/undici/releases\">undici's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v8.9.0</h2>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>fix(decompress): preserve response trailers by <a href=\"https://github.com/Ram-blip\"><code>@\u200bRam-blip</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5572\">nodejs/undici#5572</a></li>\n<li>build(deps-dev): bump ws from 8.21.0 to 8.21.1 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@\u200bdependabot</code></a>[bot] in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5576\">nodejs/undici#5576</a></li>\n<li>fix: validate coerced header values for CRLF by <a href=\"https://github.com/mcollina\"><code>@\u200bmcollina</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5579\">nodejs/undici#5579</a></li>\n<li>fix: handle frozen globalThis in setGlobalDispatcher by <a href=\"https://github.com/mhayk\"><code>@\u200bmhayk</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5574\">nodejs/undici#5574</a></li>\n<li>Ignore auto-generated .npmrc on Windows by <a href=\"https://github.com/tsctx\"><code>@\u200btsctx</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5583\">nodejs/undici#5583</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>New Contributors</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mhayk\"><code>@\u200bmhayk</code></a> made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5574\">nodejs/undici#5574</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/nodejs/undici/compare/v8.8.0...v8.9.0\">https://github.com/nodejs/undici/compare/v8.8.0...v8.9.0</a></p>\n<h2>v8.8.0</h2>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>fetch: use ReadableStreamTee for cloning streams by <a href=\"https://github.com/KhafraDev\"><code>@\u200bKhafraDev</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5517\">nodejs/undici#5517</a></li>\n<li>fix(benchmarks): adjust got after v15 upgrade by <a href=\"https://github.com/slagiewka\"><code>@\u200bslagiewka</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5526\">nodejs/undici#5526</a></li>\n<li>feat(mock): support asynchronous reply options callbacks by <a href=\"https://github.com/Develop-KIM\"><code>@\u200bDevelop-KIM</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5534\">nodejs/undici#5534</a></li>\n<li>docs: clarify proxy threat model by <a href=\"https://github.com/mcollina\"><code>@\u200bmcollina</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5530\">nodejs/undici#5530</a></li>\n<li>docs: clarify MockAgent pool usage by <a href=\"https://github.com/vibhor-aggr\"><code>@\u200bvibhor-aggr</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5542\">nodejs/undici#5542</a></li>\n<li>docs: clarify parser timeout precision by <a href=\"https://github.com/vibhor-aggr\"><code>@\u200bvibhor-aggr</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5543\">nodejs/undici#5543</a></li>\n<li>fix: handle flat alternating header arrays in cache normalizeHeaders by <a href=\"https://github.com/mcollina\"><code>@\u200bmcollina</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5536\">nodejs/undici#5536</a></li>\n<li>chore(benchmarks): require(esm) on ESM-only packages by <a href=\"https://github.com/slagiewka\"><code>@\u200bslagiewka</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5527\">nodejs/undici#5527</a></li>\n<li>fix: run idle socket validation off setImmediate instead of setTimeout by <a href=\"https://github.com/carlotestor\"><code>@\u200bcarlotestor</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5499\">nodejs/undici#5499</a></li>\n<li>docs: add custom interceptor example by <a href=\"https://github.com/vibhor-aggr\"><code>@\u200bvibhor-aggr</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5548\">nodejs/undici#5548</a></li>\n<li>fix(h1): ignore type of service errors by <a href=\"https://github.com/mcollina\"><code>@\u200bmcollina</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5547\">nodejs/undici#5547</a></li>\n<li>fix(fetch): convert null init in Response.json by <a href=\"https://github.com/Ram-blip\"><code>@\u200bRam-blip</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5540\">nodejs/undici#5540</a></li>\n<li>fix(redirect): remove body headers after POST-to-GET by <a href=\"https://github.com/Ram-blip\"><code>@\u200bRam-blip</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5551\">nodejs/undici#5551</a></li>\n<li>build(deps-dev): bump fast-check from 4.8.0 to 4.9.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@\u200bdependabot</code></a>[bot] in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5556\">nodejs/undici#5556</a></li>\n<li>fix(h2): allow stream-bodied requests to multiplex on a busy session by <a href=\"https://github.com/GiHoon1123\"><code>@\u200bGiHoon1123</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5538\">nodejs/undici#5538</a></li>\n<li>fix(h2): destroy aborted stream synchronously instead of via setImmediate by <a href=\"https://github.com/staylor\"><code>@\u200bstaylor</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5559\">nodejs/undici#5559</a></li>\n<li>fix(decompress): skip HEAD responses by <a href=\"https://github.com/Ram-blip\"><code>@\u200bRam-blip</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5564\">nodejs/undici#5564</a></li>\n<li>ci: build undici with node.js v26 by <a href=\"https://github.com/shivarm\"><code>@\u200bshivarm</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5237\">nodejs/undici#5237</a></li>\n<li>docs: clarify top-level request option url fields by <a href=\"https://github.com/vibhor-aggr\"><code>@\u200bvibhor-aggr</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5545\">nodejs/undici#5545</a></li>\n<li>test: add unexpected disconnect guards to http2 tests by <a href=\"https://github.com/Develop-KIM\"><code>@\u200bDevelop-KIM</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5533\">nodejs/undici#5533</a></li>\n<li>fix: track origins by client map key in Agent teardown by <a href=\"https://github.com/emmayusufu\"><code>@\u200bemmayusufu</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5537\">nodejs/undici#5537</a></li>\n<li>fix: enforce must-revalidate and proxy-revalidate over max-stale and stale-if-error by <a href=\"https://github.com/jeswr\"><code>@\u200bjeswr</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5511\">nodejs/undici#5511</a></li>\n<li>fix(retry): handle Retry-After zero delay by <a href=\"https://github.com/Ram-blip\"><code>@\u200bRam-blip</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5519\">nodejs/undici#5519</a></li>\n<li>fix: honor stale-if-error on connection errors during revalidation by <a href=\"https://github.com/jeswr\"><code>@\u200bjeswr</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5513\">nodejs/undici#5513</a></li>\n<li>fix: store revalidation-only responses so etag revalidation can engage by <a href=\"https://github.com/jeswr\"><code>@\u200bjeswr</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5515\">nodejs/undici#5515</a></li>\n<li>fix(h2): prevent uncaughtException from onHttp2SocketError accessing undefined kClient by <a href=\"https://github.com/mcollina\"><code>@\u200bmcollina</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5546\">nodejs/undici#5546</a></li>\n<li>fix(h2): complete request stream on 'end' instead of waiting for 'close' by <a href=\"https://github.com/staylor\"><code>@\u200bstaylor</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5560\">nodejs/undici#5560</a></li>\n<li>fix: invalidate Location and Content-Location URIs on unsafe methods by <a href=\"https://github.com/jeswr\"><code>@\u200bjeswr</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5514\">nodejs/undici#5514</a></li>\n<li>test: deflake invalid websocket close status test by <a href=\"https://github.com/mcollina\"><code>@\u200bmcollina</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5550\">nodejs/undici#5550</a></li>\n<li>refactor: replace tspl with node:test t.plan in connect-timeout tests by <a href=\"https://github.com/mcollina\"><code>@\u200bmcollina</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5518\">nodejs/undici#5518</a></li>\n<li>fix(h2): release completed requests from queue by <a href=\"https://github.com/staylor\"><code>@\u200bstaylor</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5569\">nodejs/undici#5569</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>New Contributors</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Develop-KIM\"><code>@\u200bDevelop-KIM</code></a> made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5534\">nodejs/undici#5534</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/carlotestor\"><code>@\u200bcarlotestor</code></a> made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/nodejs/undici/pull/5499\">nodejs/undici#5499</a></li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summa