+      "messageBody": "\u2026n (P-23 safe subset)\n\nAligns agent-facing rules and operator docs with\nclaudedocs/mcp-fleet-multi-instance-design-2026-07-28.md, building on the\nlegacy-script removal in b2f2f2d20f. Adds a sharing-class + command-surface\nsubsection to AGENTS.md \u00a712 and a compact pointer in .claude/CLAUDE.md;\nreplaces the stale pre-#1052 port_allocator catch-22 workaround in\nmcp-integration-guide.md with the current identity-probe behavior; adds a\nDEPRECATED banner to instance-state-persistence.md for the superseded\nlettered A-E instance model; and sweeps live operator-facing docs (tutorials,\nhow-tos, current reference/explanation docs) to stop presenting port :8000 as\nthe task-orchestrator MCP (canonical is the Kotlin jar on :7890),\nregistry.yaml as the current MCP source of truth (superseded by\nmcp_catalog.yaml per ADR-MCPINT-001), or the lettered A-E instance model as\ncurrent outside the one file that documents it. Dated audit/research/history\nsnapshots under docs/90-adr, docs/archive, docs/04-explanation/history,\ndocs/05-audit-reports, docs/06-research, claudedocs, task-packets, and reports\nwere deliberately left untouched.\n\nFiles touched:\n- AGENTS.md, .claude/claude.md \u2014 new sharing-class/lifecycle subsection + pointer\n- docs/02-how-to/mcp-integration-guide.md \u2014 stale port-allocator workaround replaced\n- docs/02-how-to/instance-state-persistence.md \u2014 DEPRECATED banner added\n- docs/01-tutorials/{quickstart,start-here,start-here-2,start-here-3}.md \u2014 :8000 vs :7890 clarified\n- docs/02-how-to/deployment-guide.md, multi-instance-workflow.md,\n  operations/{pm-plane-runtime-recovery,workflow-idea-epic-lifecycle}.md\n- docs/03-reference/dcp/chatgpt-mcp-readonly/{MULTI_PROJECT_REGISTRY_CONTRACT,TUNNEL_INTEGRATION}.md\n- docs/03-reference/services/server-registry{,-2}.md\n- docs/03-reference/systems/dddpg/{architecture-analysis,quick-reference,readme-start-here,storage-design}.md\n- docs/03-reference/systems/do