 widgets render rich `Panel`s/markup using dopemux **theme**\nstyle names (`warning`, `text.dim`, `label`, `mint`, …). Textual renders\nwidgets via `app.console` (`textual.visual.render_strips`), which never\nhad `DOPEMUX_THEME` registered — so the first themed render (TrendsPanel\nborder `border_style=\"warning\"`) raised.\n\n## Fix\nRegister `DOPEMUX_THEME` on the app console in\n`DopemuxDashboard.on_mount` (before the first paint), so every dopemux\ntheme style name resolves — not just the one border.\n\n## Validation\n- **PASS** — new `tests/test_dashboard_theme_regression.py` reproduces\nthe crash via Textual `run_test()` (fails before, passes after); full\nheadless render (`export_screenshot`) of the whole dashboard succeeds\n(TrendsPanel rendered, 51KB SVG).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","messageHeadline":"fix(dashboard): register dopemux theme on Textual app console (#952)","oid":"9a8414413f0ebe9d0cc585e03b45cd9e6221482e"},{"authoredDate":"2026-06-20T19:22:54Z","authors":[{"email":"167156098+hu3mann@users.noreply.github.com","id":"U_kgDOCfaZgg","login":"hu3mann","name":"DDD-Enterprises (DJ Daddy Dom & the Department of… Don’t ask, Don’t tell, Don’t stop, Don’t you dare…)"},{"email":"noreply@anthropic.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","login":"claude","name":"Claude Opus 4.8"}],"committedDate":"2026-06-22T20:49:19Z","messageBody":"…ediation\n\nFocused slice of TP-DMX-MEMORY-TRINITY-001, split from PR #939 (Docker fix already merged via\n#942; skills install -> #939; proof churn dropped).\n\nContents: Memory Trinity ADR + .claude/modules/shared/memory-trinity-routing.md, .claude/commands\nremediation (incl. tm:* command removal), AGENTS authority matrix, docs_index skills catalog,\nmemory/skill-frontmatter validators + the templates/skills frontmatter fixes they require,\nsync_repo_skills.py with a complete 20-skill FAMILIES map, and a per-PR proof bundle\n(proof/TP-DMX-MEMORY-TRINITY-001-LAW/).\n\nValidators PASS; rebased clean on main; required CI green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","messageHeadline":"feat(memory): Memory Trinity law + dope-context routing + command rem…","oid":"8e48a3e2da03656e3bc88451daeebf3bc4226ae2"},{"authoredDate":"2026-06-22T20:54:35Z","authors":[{"email":"167156098+hu3mann@users.noreply.github.com","id":"U_kgDOCfaZgg","login":"hu3mann","name":"Dj Dom"},{"email":"noreply@anthropic.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","login":"claude","name":"Claude Opus 4.8"}],"committedDate":"2026-06-22T20:54:35Z","messageBody":"…ithub/skills) (#939)\n\n> **This PR was repurposed.** It previously carried the\nTP-DMX-MEMORY-TRINITY-001 mega-change (396 files). Per the supervisor\nBLOCK verdict, that work was split into focused PRs. This PR is now\n**only the skills-install slice (D2)**.\n\n## What this is\nInstalls all **20** `templates/skills` into both targets —\n`.claude/skills/` and `.github/skills/` (216 files) — via the 20-family\n`sync_repo_skills.py`.\n\n## Split map\n- **Memory Trinity law / routing / command remediation / validators /\nsync tool** → #947 (`feat/memory-trinity-law`)\n- **Docker build fix** (the original title) → already merged via #942\n- **This PR (#939)** → skills install output only\n- **Old 396-file mega-state** → archived at tag\n`archive/pr939-mega-20260620` (`1e76e4fa5`), recoverable\n\n## 20/20 coverage\nResolves the prior 17/20 gap: `ci-remediation-specialist`,\n`load-orchestrator-persona`, `vibe-pr-merge` are now covered by new\n`ops` / `pr-merge-specialist` FAMILIES entries (the tool + map live in\n#947).\n\n## Merge order\nMerge **#947 first** (it ships the sync tool, FAMILIES map, and the\n`templates/skills` frontmatter fixes). The installed skills here are\nself-contained copies, so CI is independent.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","messageHeadline":"feat(skills): ins