+{"baseRefName":"main","body":"## Summary\n\nImplements **ADR-DMX-MCPPROF-001** (Accepted 2026-07-26) after operator phrase `ACCEPT AND EXECUTE TP-MCP-PROFILE-PROGRAM-001-R1` (supervisor packet `TP-MCP-PROFILE-PROGRAM-001-R1`).\n\nAdds deterministic **profile-selected MCP tool plane**:\n\n- Profiles in `mcp_catalog.yaml` (no implicit `all`)\n- `profile_policy.py` inventory, digests, admin/write filters, fixed-path `repo-domain-read` contract\n- CLI: `dopemux mcp profile list|show`, `doctor --profile`, `init --profile`, `generate --profile`\n- Official GitHub read-only server entry + specialized Playwright/Semgrep/domain-read placement\n- Unit tests for fail-closed negatives; docs + mcp-system PAL stdio truth\n\n**Merge is NOT authorized** by this packet.\n\n### Allowlist amendment (supervisor-approved)\n\n- `schemas/mcp/fleet-catalog.schema.json` — `profiles` + enums for new servers\n- `src/dopemux/mcp/default_catalog.yaml` — keep in sync with root catalog\n- `mcp_tool_surfaces.json` — planned/seed keys for new servers (live capture unavailable)\n\n### Acceptance evidence\n\n- ADR status: **Accepted** with date 2026-07-26, operator phrase, unlocks `TP-DMX-MCPPROF-001`\n- Proof: `proof/TP-DMX-MCPPROF-001/`\n- Auditor: `PASS_WITH_RISKS` (second-pass invariant audit; formal AGY/Claude CLI not available)\n\n### Profile digests (core)\n\n| Profile | tools | profile_digest (prefix) |\n|---|---:|---|\n| core-code | 51 | `27f4d06e9c55…` |\n| core-retrieval | 42 | `d1eba84d64a7…` |\n| planning-audit | 15 | `e9e8f92d5c7d…` |\n| ui-audit | 8 | `2afe4e86f8d5…` (domain-read blocked without contract) |\n\n### Validation (local)\n\n- profile unit tests: PASS\n- mcp unit filter + arch fleet catalog: PASS\n- ruff on touched modules: PASS\n- mypy: FAIL (pre-existing noise on mcp_commands/fleet_catalog; recorded)\n- `git diff --check`: PASS\n\n### Residual risks\n\n- GitHub tool names seeded for policy filters; refresh with live snapshot when available\n- `repo-domain-read` blocked until repo ships fixed executable+manifest\n- Agent-matrix generate remains for OpenCode/Codex parity; task profiles are the non-all plane\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `uv run pytest -q tests/unit/test_mcp_profile_*.py`\n- [x] `uv run pytest -q tests/arch/test_mcp_fleet_catalog_contract.py`\n- [x] `dopemux mcp profile list|show core-code`\n- [x] `dopemux mcp doctor --profile core-code|ui-audit`\n- [ ] CI on PR head","commits":[{"authoredDate":"2026-07-27T00:30:11Z","authors":[{"email":"167156098+hu3mann@users.noreply.github.com","id":"U_kgDOCfaZgg","login":"hu3mann","name":"DDD-Enterprises (DJ Daddy Dom & the Department of… Don’t ask, Don’t tell, Don’t stop, Don’t you dare…)"}],"committedDate":"2026-07-27T00:30:11Z","messageBody":"Operator acceptance 2026-07-26 via ACCEPT AND EXECUTE\nTP-MCP-PROFILE-PROGRAM-001-R1 unlocks TP-DMX-MCPPROF-001.","messageHeadline":"docs(adr): accept ADR-DMX-MCPPROF-001 profiled tool plane","oid":"0b3c0a903069d017478e53a700d1c71ca46b8f01"},{"authoredDate":"2026-07-27T00:30:12Z","authors":[{"email":"167156098+hu3mann@users.noreply.github.com","id":"U_kgDOCfaZgg","login":"hu3mann","name":"DDD-Enterprises (DJ Daddy Dom & the Department of… Don’t ask, Don’t tell, Don’t stop, Don’t you dare…)"}],"committedDate":"2026-07-27T00:30:12Z","messageBody":"Add profiles to mcp_catalog.yaml, fleet schema enums for specialized\nservers, deterministic profile_policy inventory/digests, and planned\ntool-surface keys (supervisor-approved amendment).","messageHeadline":"feat(mcp): profile schema, catalog profiles, profile_policy","oid":"165674b5752200ebdf3a5399a79da2e1874f5c31"},{"authoredDate":"2026-07-27T00:30:12Z","authors":[{"email":"167156098+hu3mann@users.noreply.github.com","id":"U_kgDOCfaZgg","login":"hu3mann","name":"DDD-Enterprises (DJ Daddy Dom & the Department of… Don’t ask, Don’t tell, Don’t stop, Don’t you dare…)"}],"committedDate":"2026-07-27T00:30:12Z","messageBody":"Wire --profile on generate/init/doctor; profile group commands;\ngenerate_profile