+{"baseRefName":"main","body":"## Summary\n\n- **Bug:** Solo-owner security-release policy assumed GitHub `authorAssociation=OWNER`. On organization-owned repositories (`DDD-Enterprises/dopemux-mvp`), the sole trusted human maintainer is reported as **`MEMBER`**, so legitimate exact-head solo authorization was rejected early.\n- **Fix:** Define `_SOLO_OPERATOR_ASSOCIATIONS = {OWNER, MEMBER}` for PR author association, authorization-comment association, and receipt generation. Add fail-closed `SOLO_OWNER_ASSOCIATION_MISMATCH` when both associations are present and differ.\n- **Unchanged:** Exact single-person trusted roster; `COLLABORATOR` rejected; non-author trusted approver disables solo path; exact PR number + full 40-char head SHA; audit/proof/CI/review-thread/reviewer-classification/harvest/mixed-SHA gates independently blocking; auto-merge disabled; solo receipt never becomes a fabricated GitHub review.\n- **Not this PR:** Does **not** approve or modify product PR **#1126**. Does **not** authorize deployment. Does **not** change the organization-owned GitHub App security-release path from PR **#1133**.\n\n## Trust-root bootstrap\n\nThis PR changes `tools/pr_steward/**`, so the currently deployed solo-owner path on `main` may still reject `MEMBER` authorization for **this** PR. Expected Steward status before merge may be `NEEDS_SUPERVISOR` with sole blocker `SECURITY_RELEASE_APPROVAL_REQUIRED` (association recursion). One-time administrative bootstrap merge is authorized **only** for this association-repair PR when CI is green, proof/audit pass, allowlist holds, and the sole Steward blocker is that recursion. Auto-merge must not be used.\n\n## Packet\n\n- `TP-PRSTEWARD-SOLO-OWNER-ORG-MEMBER-001`\n- Parent: `ADR-DMX-PRSTEWARD-SOLOOWNER-001` / PR #1131\n- Embedded audit: **PASS_WITH_RISKS** (Claude Code CLI Sonnet, independent session)\n- Proof: `proof/TP-PRSTEWARD-SOLO-OWNER-ORG-MEMBER-001/`\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `python -m compileall -q tools/pr_steward`\n- [x] `uv run pytest -q tests/pr_steward/test_solo_owner_security_release.py tests/pr_steward/test_classifier_solo_owner.py tests/pr_steward/test_trusted_security_approvers.py tests/pr_steward/test_security_release_approval.py`\n- [x] `uv run pytest -q tests/pr_steward/` (zero failures)\n- [x] `PYTHONPATH=. python -m tools.pr_steward.intake --help`\n- [x] `git diff --check`\n- [x] pre-commit on allowlisted files\n- [ ] CI green on this PR head\n- [ ] After merge: re-run Steward on #1126 at exact head `ba8a78fa1ed09dc0d7cbb9f2b2680508c6fa13a3` (do not repost phrase unless head changes)","commits":[{"authoredDate":"2026-07-27T04:42:22Z","authors":[{"email":"167156098+hu3mann@users.noreply.github.com","id":"U_kgDOCfaZgg","login":"hu3mann","name":"DDD-Enterprises (DJ Daddy Dom & the Department of… Don’t ask, Don’t tell, Don’t stop, Don’t you dare…)"}],"committedDate":"2026-07-27T04:43:01Z","messageBody":"GitHub reports organization maintainers as MEMBER, not OWNER. Expand the\nsolo-owner security-release association set to {OWNER, MEMBER}, reject\nCOLLABORATOR, and fail closed on PR/comment association mismatch.\n\nDoes not approve PR #1126, authorize deployment, or change the org-owned\napp approval path. Trust-root bootstrap PR for ADR-DMX-PRSTEWARD-SOLOOWNER-001.\n\nPacket: TP-PRSTEWARD-SOLO-OWNER-ORG-MEMBER-001","messageHeadline":"fix(pr-steward): support solo org members in exact-head authorization","oid":"9326e664bf46510db33e5fe4968d54ceda1f3b69"},{"authoredDate":"2026-07-27T04:43:01Z","authors":[{"email":"167156098+hu3mann@users.noreply.github.com","id":"U_kgDOCfaZgg","login":"hu3mann","name":"DDD-Enterprises (DJ Daddy Dom & the Department of… Don’t ask, Don’t tell, Don’t stop, Don’t you dare…)"}],"committedDate":"2026-07-27T04:43:01Z","messageBody":"Bind embedded-audit proof head_sha to the policy-repair commit.","messageHeadline":"proof(TP-PRSTEWARD-SOLO-OWNER-ORG-MEMBER-001): pin exact head SHA","oid":"232fb713fbb927ead17ba2ead2cd1136ad3a5deb"}],"files":[{"path"